Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.20,0:00:07.06,N,,0,0,0,,Watching TV shouldn't take twenty button presses. For millions of people — older adults, people with low vision or shaky hands — it's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:08.61,N,,0,0,0,,not an annoyance. It's a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.65,0:00:18.40,N,,0,0,0,,Meet Couch Pilot, the self-driving remote. You say the goal. It drives the TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:25.66,U,,0,0,0,,🎙 Mireille, 78
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:40.95,N,,0,0,0,,One sentence. Four steps. Zero clicks. And Mireille sees every step as it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.31,0:00:45.86,U,,0,0,0,,🎙 Léa, mum of two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.58,0:01:05.96,N,,0,0,0,,Voice, remote and screen in one flow. When it's not sure, it asks one question — never more. Kids mode caps the volume and stops after 30
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.96,0:01:06.39,N,,0,0,0,,minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.09,0:01:12.55,U,,0,0,0,,🎙 Thomas
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.79,0:01:30.94,N,,0,0,0,,Routines turn a whole evening into two words. And yes, it remembers the reminder.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.20,0:01:37.03,U,,0,0,0,,🎙 Thomas
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.74,0:01:48.92,U,,0,0,0,,🎙 Thomas
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:56.69,U,,0,0,0,,🎙 Thomas
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:01.07,U,,0,0,0,,🎙 Thomas
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.63,0:02:09.32,N,,0,0,0,,Anything that costs money needs a yes. One word — or the Back button — stops it. You're always in control.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.03,0:02:19.38,N,,0,0,0,,Under the hood: Alexa+ understands, Couch Pilot acts. Couch Pilot is an MCP server on the latest MCP spec (2025-11-25), over Streamable
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.38,0:02:23.96,N,,0,0,0,,HTTP. Any Alexa+ agent can hand it a goal — and the Fire TV drives itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.15,0:02:30.23,N,,0,0,0,,For everyone the remote left behind. Couch Pilot.
